sequenceDiagram
    participant gateway as Gateway
    participant ingest as API + Ingestion
    participant queue as SQS FIFO
    participant process as Processor
    participant stores as S3 + DynamoDB
    gateway->>ingest: Signed readings
    ingest->>queue: Validate; enqueue stable batch
    ingest->>gateway: 202 after queue acceptance
    queue->>process: Batch event source mapping
    process->>stores: Conditional S3 date archive
    process->>stores: DDB atomic event/state/alert write
    process->>queue: Success or failed/unprocessed IDs
    queue->>process: Retry until DLQ receive limit
